WEBVTT

00:06:28.926 --> 00:06:32.054
of the lifetime earnings
of a single whale.

00:06:32.555 --> 00:06:34.098
Would you like to know how much?

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:35.558
(Applause)

00:06:36.809 --> 00:06:38.436
Would you like to know how much?

00:06:38.436 --> 00:06:39.854
Audience: Yes!

00:06:40.312 --> 00:06:42.314
RC: At least three million dollars.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:44.442
At least.

00:06:45.234 --> 00:06:48.028
Because I'm leaving so much out of this.

00:06:48.028 --> 00:06:51.449
But I just wanted to tell the good news
that I heard on that boat.

00:06:51.449 --> 00:06:54.076
I didn't know what to do.
I was trying to help them out.

00:06:55.369 --> 00:06:57.913
But there's more good news.
Would you like to hear it?

00:06:57.955 --> 00:06:59.623
Audience: Yes!

00:06:59.665 --> 00:07:04.378
RC: Their cousins on land,
the elephants in the forests of Africa,